# PHASE 20 — ADVANCED TEACHER PORTAL, TEACHER WORKSPACE & ACADEMIC OPERATIONS

## IMPORTANT CONTEXT

This is PHASE 20 of an already-developed, production-oriented, multi-school School ERP.

DO NOT create a new application.

DO NOT rebuild the ERP from scratch.

DO NOT create a second Teacher Management System.

DO NOT create duplicate Teacher, Employee, Attendance, Examination, Homework, Timetable, HR, Communication, or Student databases.

First inspect the complete existing codebase, database schema, authentication, RBAC, school isolation, Teacher & Staff module, Attendance, Examination, Timetable, Homework, Student, Parent, Communication, HR/Payroll, Student Portal, Parent Portal, Student Lifecycle, Documents, Certificates, MIS/Analytics, Mobile/PWA and existing APIs.

Then extend the existing architecture safely.

Reuse existing:

- Teacher/Employee records
- User accounts
- Roles
- Schools
- Academic sessions
- Classes
- Sections
- Subjects
- Student records
- Attendance
- Examination
- Marks
- Timetable
- Homework
- Study materials
- Communication
- Leave
- HR/Payroll
- Notifications
- Calendar
- Reports
- Audit logs
- Mobile/PWA
- Parent/Student portals

Do not duplicate existing business logic.

